    13	* **LFM3 final**: v4 (prompt v4 with installed-app list) if it passes the development gate below; otherwise v3 and v1
    14	  are reported (v1 = best seed-30 model; neither receives an app list, which can only favour GUI-Owl).
    15	* **LFM3 v1** (reference, original prompt).
